	<object class="Event" id="{099eee17-c0d6-420e-92ab-959e32aa8da1}">
		<property name="note">
			<value>Plays once when a big door starts opening (3 doors in Level1).
Original clip (Door_Open_Big_01) is 10.3 s, but door travel times differ:
  DoorHuge2 = 3 s (pressure pad 2)
  DoorHuge  = 5 s (3 switches, plays a short cutscene)
  DoorHuge1 = 8 s (pressure pad 1)
The sound runs on after each door stops, so design one event that works
for all three (e.g. motion up front + long tail). If you add a "landing"
thud, time it for the 3 s door or it will land late.
</value>
		</property>
